	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You train hard, and you play hard, burning the candle at both ends when you’re not in the field. When taking downtime activities, you may choose the Gather Information activity in addition to one other activity of your choice, so long as there is a tavern or other location so you can carouse. You still pay gold for each activity as normal, but also suffer a level of fatigue at the end of both activities.</p>",
